{{define "title"}}About{{end}}
{{define "main"}}
<div class='narrow prose'>
    <h1>About bookmarkbox</h1>
    <p>
        <b>bookmarkbox</b> is a personal bookmark manager written in Go. Each
        person
        keeps their own private collection of links, grouped with tags.
    </p>
    <p>
        It began as the Snippetbox example from
        <a href='https://lets-go.alexedwards.net/'>Let's Go by Alex Edwards</a>.
        The source is on <a
            href='https://github.com/darrenpaine/bookmarkbox'>GitHub</a>.
    </p>
</div>
{{end}}
